-- Q2539: Fix #9
UPDATE questions SET
  stem = $EXPL$Thompson inherited 500 shares of stock from her grandmother, who originally purchased them for $12,000. On the date of death, the shares were worth $78,000. Thompson is determining her tax basis for computing gain if she sells., what basis does inherited property receive?$EXPL$
