-- Q2540: Fix #9
UPDATE questions SET
  stem = $EXPL$Henderson died on April 3, 2026. Between the date of death and six months later, the value of Henderson''s estate assets declined by $800,000. The executor is considering an election to value the estate at a later date., when can an estate elect the alternate valuation date?$EXPL$
