  stem = $EXPL$During 2026, Wallace received $52,000 in wages, $3,000 in municipal bond interest, and a $10,000 gift from her parents. Her tax advisor is identifying which items are taxable. Which of the following is NOT included in gross income ?$EXPL$,
  explanation = $EXPL$Life insurance death benefit proceeds received by a beneficiary are excluded from gross income under Section 101(a). Jury duty pay, unemployment compensation, and cancellation of indebtedness income are all included in gross income. COD income has exceptions (bankruptcy, insolvency, qualified farm/real property debt), but it is generally taxable. (See Section 61.)$EXPL$
