-- Q3762: Fix #9
UPDATE questions SET
  stem = $EXPL$CloudPay Solutions provides payroll processing to 300 client companies. During the SOC 1 engagement, the service auditor identifies the organizations that rely on CloudPay''s controls for their own financial reporting. Under, a user entity is defined as which of the following?$EXPL$
