-- Q5343: Fix #9
UPDATE questions SET
  stem = $EXPL$The City of Harborview enters a tax abatement agreement with Greenleaf Manufacturing, reducing Greenleaf's property taxes by $750,000 annually for 10 years to incentivize construction of a new facility. The city's total property tax levy is $42,000,000., what is the most significant reporting impact?$EXPL$
