  stem = $EXPL$The City of Millbrook discovers contaminated soil at a former municipal landfill site. An environmental consulting firm estimates remediation costs between $3,200,000 and $5,800,000, with no amount within the range more likely than any other. The city has received a compliance order from the state environmental agency., what amount should the city recognize as a liability?$EXPL$
