-- Q5364: Fix #9
UPDATE questions SET
  stem = $EXPL$On March 1, 2026, the Riverside Foundation awards a $1,500,000 reimbursement-basis grant to the City of Riverside for youth center construction. The grant requires the city to incur and document qualifying construction expenditures before requesting reimbursement. As of the June 30, 2026, fiscal year-end, the city has incurred $420,000 in qualifying construction costs and received $420,000 in reimbursement., how much grant revenue should the city recognize in the General Fund for fiscal year 2026?$EXPL$
