  stem = $EXPL$The City of Crestwood's internal service fund provides fleet maintenance to the police department at a billed rate of $180,000 per quarter. During fiscal year 2026, the police department's general fund paid $720,000 to the internal service fund for these services., how should the $720,000 be reported in the general fund?$EXPL$
