-- Q5453: Fix #9
UPDATE questions SET
  stem = $EXPL$The city of Brookhaven is preparing its general fund balance sheet for the fiscal year ended June 30, 2025. The finance director is classifying fund balance components according to What does assigned fund balance represent?$EXPL$,
  explanation = $EXPL$Under GASB 54, paragraph 13, assigned fund balance represents amounts that a government intends to use for a specific purpose. Assignment can be made by the governing body or by an official delegated that authority. Unlike committed fund balance, formal action by the highest decision-making authority is not required. Choice D is incorrect because it describes committed fund balance, which requires formal action by the governing body rather than merely an expressed intent. (See GASB 54..)$EXPL$
WHERE id = 5453;

