  stem = $EXPL$Falcon Corp owns 30% of Eagle Corp and receives $200,000 in dividends. Falcon's taxable income before the DRD is $120,000. The 65% DRD would be $130,000, which exceeds the taxable income limitation of $78,000. How does resolve this limitation?$EXPL$
