  stem = $EXPL$Hayward & Associates completes an audit of financial statements prepared on the income tax basis for Stratton Automotive Group. The auditor concludes the statements are fairly presented in accordance with the tax basis. Under AU-C, the auditor's report on SPF financial statements must include which specific paragraph?$EXPL$
