-- Q11541: Fix #9
UPDATE questions SET
  stem = $EXPL$Cascade Pharmaceuticals faces a product liability lawsuit. Outside counsel estimates a 60% probability of adverse outcome with an expected loss of $5,200,000., "probable" generally means likelihood exceeding 75%, while under IAS 37, "probable" means more likely than not (exceeding 50%). Analyze the recognition differences between the two frameworks for this lawsuit.$EXPL$
