-- Q11630: Fix #9
UPDATE questions SET
  stem = $EXPL$Whitfield Tech incurs $400,000 in internal-use software development costs during Year 2. Of this amount, $280,000 relates to the application development stage and is capitalized, while $120,000 relates to preliminary project activities and is expensed. How do these costs most likely affect the statement of cash flows?$EXPL$
