-- Q11663: Fix #9
UPDATE questions SET
  stem = $EXPL$Greystone Manufacturing recently changed its depreciation method and also corrected a prior-period inventory error. The CFO asks the accounting team to identify which modifications require treatment Which of the following types of accounting changes falls within the scope of ?$EXPL$,
  explanation = $EXPL$ASC 250-10-15-1 establishes the scope to include changes in accounting principle, changes in accounting estimate, and corrections of errors in previously issued financial statements. It also addresses changes in reporting entity. Option B is outside the scope because ASC 250 applies to changes from one acceptable method to another, not first-time GAAP adoption. Options A and C involve operational procedures, not accounting measurements. (See ASC 250..)$EXPL$
