  stem = $EXPL$Harborview City's general fund originally budgeted $15.2 million in revenues and $14.8 million in appropriations. A mid-year amendment increased appropriations to $15.1 million. Actual revenues total $15.4 million and expenditures total $14.9 million., determine which budget columns must appear in the required budgetary comparison schedule.$EXPL$
