-- Q12296: Fix #9
UPDATE questions SET
  stem = $EXPL$NetMarket Corp. operates an online marketplace where third-party sellers list products. NetMarket processes payments, takes a 15% commission, and remits the balance to sellers. NetMarket does not take title to the inventory or bear inventory risk., should NetMarket recognize revenue gross or net?$EXPL$
