  stem = $EXPL$Ridgeline Corp. issues $5,000,000 in 10-year bonds at par on March 1, 2026, and pays $120,000 in debt issuance costs to underwriters at closing. Under ASU 2015-03, the issuance costs are netted against the bond liability on the balance sheet. The CFO proposes reporting a net $4,880,000 financing inflow. The controller argues that requires gross presentation of the $5,000,000 inflow and a separate $120,000 financing outflow. Evaluate which approach is correct.$EXPL$
