  stem = $EXPL$Fletcher contributes property with a basis of $80,000 and FMV of $200,000 to a 50-50 partnership. The partnership has $100,000 of nonrecourse liabilities that Fletcher shares equally. Fletcher's capital account is $200,000 (FMV of contribution). Determine Fletcher's outside basis and explain why it differs from the capital account.$EXPL$
