  stem = $EXPL$Crestline Corp operates a retail division and a real estate division. The sole shareholder wants to separate the real estate division into a new corporation so that a potential buyer can acquire only the retail division without exposure to real estate liabilities. Crestline distributes all stock of the new real estate corporation to the shareholder. Is the business purpose requirement of satisfied?$EXPL$
