  stem = $EXPL$Windfall Ventures recently completed a Series B preferred stock financing round at $15 per share, raising $30 million for a 20% ownership stake. The lead investor negotiated a 1x liquidation preference and participation rights. An independent appraiser is asked to determine the fair value of the company's common stock for purposes. The appraiser uses the backsolve method. This approach:$EXPL$
