-- Q14510: Fix #9
UPDATE questions SET
  stem = $EXPL$Cascade Partners incurs $30,000 in organizational costs (legal fees for drafting the partnership agreement) and $45,000 in syndication costs (brokerage commissions for selling partnership interests) during formation., the partnership elects to deduct $5,000 of organizational costs and amortize the remaining $25,000 over 180 months. Analyze the effect of these costs on the partners' outside basis.$EXPL$
