  stem = $EXPL$In Scenario A, Oakmont Inc. sells a building (carrying value $400,000, fair value $600,000) for exactly $600,000 and leases it back at market rental rates. In Scenario B, Oakmont sells an identical building for $500,000 (below fair value) and leases it back at below-market rental rates that compensate for the $100,000 shortfall. Both transfers qualify as sales. Evaluate how treats the pricing difference in Scenario B and compare the gain recognition in each scenario.$EXPL$
